<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $64-3/4 (FIM 307.30).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $64-3/4 (FIM 307.30).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed down $0-1/8 at $64-3/4 in New York on Thursday.</p>
<p>Nokia's Wall Street closing equals about 307.30 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Thursday, Nokia A closed up 4.00 markka at 307.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed flat at $34-1/8 on Wall Street. The price equals about 81.00 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 0.30 markka at 80.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR was flat at $20 in New York on Thursday. The price corresponds to about 94.90 markka. In Helsinki, Rauma closed up 2.10 markka at 97.00 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
